{"overview":"سی‌اِس‌آی: میامی بازرسان صحنه جنایت را که برای اداره پلیس میامی-دید کار می‌کنند دنبال می‌کند، در حالی که آن‌ها از شواهد فیزیکی مشابه همتایان خود در لاس‌وگاس برای حل قتل‌های وحشتناک استفاده می‌کنند. این مجموعه‌ نتیجه‌گیری، موضوعات ناخوشایند و درام شخصیت‌محور را به همان روش مجموعه اصلی در مجموعه سی‌اِس‌آی ترکیب می‌کند، با این تفاوت که سی‌اِس‌آی‌های میامی اول پلیس هستند، بعد دانشمند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"The show follows Crime Scene Investigators working for the Miami-Dade Police Department as they use physical evidence, similar to their Las Vegas counterparts, to solve grisly murders. The series mixes deduction, gritty subject matter, and character-driven drama in the same vein as the original series in the CSI franchise, except that the Miami CSIs are cops first, scientists second.","tagline_en":"","runtime":42,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":44,"y":2004,"poster":"/AqA7WOGR8Ln68vN8FS3minsued8.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":24,"y":2002,"poster":"/9duJAosWZI9dZyKtPwl3aKwcC2T.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":24,"y":2003,"poster":"/35sfB9DPpIbgoXICR566dq2tzYx.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":24,"y":2004,"poster":"/pECopkUk4eMbcjp96DNQN0KqpP0.jpg"},{"n":4,"name":"فصل 4","ep":25,"y":2005,"poster":"/rX1mS9nRsxBWTIYFblClGedWTHb.jpg"},{"n":5,"name":"فصل 5","ep":24,"y":2006,"poster":"/x2JB7TJaAFB3iJUtqxUrxpFPC2n.jpg"},{"n":6,"name":"فصل 6","ep":21,"y":2007,"poster":"/mp5gJrig17pemwStotxFybNSMKf.jpg"},{"n":7,"name":"فصل 7","ep":25,"y":2008,"poster":"/WKF0FWlaFaeMaKV7hoxPp4CQdA.jpg"},{"n":8,"name":"فصل 8","ep":24,"y":2009,"poster":"/w5NI7KPL7qFItfsz2Grhz8qfaIs.jpg"},{"n":9,"name":"فصل 9","ep":22,"y":2010,"poster":"/1RigJcMgW9JyoXZgLcHZYle3yDW.jpg"},{"n":10,"name":"فصل 10","ep":19,"y":2011,"poster":"/c1tNnQBIGE81UaeOvgcAaG7g9CC.jpg"}],"episodes":232,"crew":["Ann Donahue","Anthony E. Zuiker","Carol Mendelsohn"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["US"],"cast":[{"name":"David Caruso","role":"Horatio Caine","photo":"/4aflRWhJW8gvnYIXPY52KcNTzkO.